Business Outlook
Intel's guidance for the fourth quarter of 2026 includes both GAAP and non-GAAP estimates as follows:
	Q4 2026		GAAP		Non-GAAP
	Revenue ($B)		
$15.0 - $16.0
	Gross margin		37.1%		38.0%
	Tax Rate		31%		11%
	Earnings (Loss) Per Share Attributable to Intel—Diluted		$0.10		$0.25
Reconciliations between GAAP and non-GAAP financial measures are included below. Actual results may differ materially from Intel’s business outlook as a result of, among other things, the factors described under “Forward-Looking Statements” below. The gross margin and EPS outlooks are based on the midpoint of the revenue range.
Earnings Webcast
Intel will hold a public webcast at 2 p.m. PT today to discuss the results for its third quarter. The live public webcast can be accessed on Intel's Investor Relations website at www.intc.com. The corresponding earnings presentation and webcast replay will also be available on the site.
Forward-Looking Statements
